{
  "model": "gpt-5-6-terra",
  "openapi": {
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
      "title": "kie.ai",
      "description": "kie.ai API 文档",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "contact": {
        "name": "技术支持",
        "email": "support@kie.ai"
      }
    },
    "tags": [],
    "paths": {
      "/codex/v1/responses": {
        "post": {
          "summary": "GPT 5.6 Terra",
          "deprecated": false,
          "description": "> GPT 5.6 Terra uses an OpenAI Responses–compatible endpoint (input/output items and response.* streaming events).\n\nContext window: 272K tokens. The response's model field uses the dotted name (e.g. gpt-5.6-sol); both spellings are accepted in requests. List the currently available models with GET /openai/v1/models.\n\n\n<CardGroup cols={2}>\n  <Card title=\"Multimodal Input\" icon=\"🖼️\">\n    Supports mixed text, image, and file inputs in a single message.\n  </Card>\n\n  <Card title=\"Reasoning Control\" icon=\"🧠\">\n    Adjustable reasoning effort from low to max.\n  </Card>\n\n  <Card title=\"Tools & Web Search\" icon=\"✨\">\n    Integrates web search or custom function calling tools.\n  </Card>\n\n  <Card title=\"Unified Endpoint\" icon=\"💻\">\n    Uses the unified <code>/codex/v1/responses</code> endpoint with <code>model</code> set to one of <code>gpt-5-6-terra</code>.\n  </Card>\n</CardGroup>\n\n## Tools & tool\\_choice\n\nThe `tools` array enables **web search** or **function calling** capabilities.\n\n:::caution\nWeb Search and Function Calling are **mutually exclusive**.  \nIn a single request you should choose only one: do not include both `{\"type\": \"web_search\"}` and `{\"type\": \"function\", ...}` in the same `tools` array.\n:::\n\n\n<AccordionGroup>\n  <Accordion title=\"Web Search\">\n    Use the built-in Web Search tool to retrieve up-to-date information:\n\n    ```json\n    {\n      \"tools\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"web_search\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n    ```\n  </Accordion>\n\n  <Accordion title=\"Function Calling\">\n    Define business functions that the model can call when needed:\n\n    ```json\n    {\n      \"tools\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"function\",\n          \"name\": \"get_current_weather\",\n          \"description\": \"Get the current weather in a given location\",\n          \"parameters\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"location\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"description\": \"The city and state, e.g. San Francisco, CA\"\n              },\n              \"unit\": {\n                \"type\": \"string\",\n                \"enum\": [\"celsius\", \"fahrenheit\"]\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\"location\", \"unit\"]\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"tool_choice\": \"auto\"\n    }\n    ```\n\n    When function tools are configured in `tools`, set `tool_choice` to `\"auto\"` so the model can decide when to call them.  \n    If you do not configure any function tools, omit the `tool_choice` field.\n  </Accordion>\n</AccordionGroup>\n\n## Error handling\n\nCheck the response body, not only the HTTP status. Errors are returned either as `{\"code\": ..., \"msg\": \"...\"}` (for example 401 invalid API key, 402 insufficient credits, 429 rate limited; the HTTP status may still be 200) or as `{\"error\": {\"type\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\"}}`.\n",
          "operationId": "gpt-5-6-terra-completions",
          "tags": [],
          "parameters": [],
          "requestBody": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Target model name. Allowed values: `gpt-5-6-terra`.",
                      "default": "gpt-5-6-terra",
                      "enum": [
                        "gpt-5-6-terra"
                      ],
                      "examples": [
                        "gpt-5-6-terra"
                      ]
                    },
                    "stream": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "description": "Defaults to true (Server-Sent Events). Set to false to receive a single JSON response.",
                      "default": true
                    },
                    "input": {
                      "oneOf": [
                        {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Input can be a string."
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "array",
                          "description": "Input can be an array; each element is a message object with role and content.",
                          "items": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "description": "A message object with role and content.",
                            "properties": {
                              "role": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Message role, e.g. `user`.",
                                "examples": [
                                  "user"
                                ]
                              },
                              "content": {
                                "type": "array",
                                "description": "Content parts: {\"type\":\"input_text\",\"text\":\"...\"}, {\"type\":\"input_image\",\"image_url\":\"<URL or data:image/...;base64,...>\"}, {\"type\":\"input_file\",\"file_url\":\"<URL>\"}.",
                                "items": {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "properties": {}
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "minItems": 1
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "reasoning": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "Reasoning configuration for the model.",
                      "properties": {
                        "effort": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Reasoning effort: low, medium, high, xhigh or max. Defaults to medium.",
                          "enum": [
                            "low",
                            "medium",
                            "high",
                            "xhigh",
                            "max"
                          ],
                          "default": "medium",
                          "examples": [
                            "low"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "tools": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "description": "Optional tools that the model may call. Either web search OR function calling should be configured, but not both simultaneously.",
                      "items": {
                        "oneOf": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolWebSearch"
                          },
                          {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ToolFunction"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    "tool_choice": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Tool selection behavior. When function tools are configured in `tools`, set this to `auto` so the model can decide when to call them.",
                      "examples": [
                        "auto"
                      ]
                    },
                    "text": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "text.format: {\"type\":\"json_schema\",\"name\":\"...\",\"strict\":true,\"schema\":{...}} makes the output follow your JSON Schema.",
                      "properties": {
                        "format": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "description": "Output format definition.",
                          "properties": {
                            "type": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Fixed value: json_schema."
                            },
                            "name": {
                              "type": "string",
                              "description": "Schema name, used to identify this schema."
                            },
                            "strict": {
                              "type": "boolean",
                              "description": "Whether to enable strict mode. When true, the output must strictly conform to the schema."
                            },
                            "schema": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "additionalProperties": true,
                              "properties": {},
                              "description": "JSON Schema of the output object, e.g. {\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"answer\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"answer\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}."
                            }
                          },
                          "required": [
                            "type",
                            "name",
                            "strict",
                            "schema"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "format"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "model",
                    "input"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "model": "gpt-5-6-terra",
                  "stream": false,
                  "input": [
                    {
                      "role": "user",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "input_text",
                          "text": "What is in this image?"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "input_image",
                          "image_url": "https://file.aiquickdraw.com/custom-page/akr/section-images/1759055072437dqlsclj2.png"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "tools": [
                    {
                      "type": "web_search"
                    }
                  ],
                  "reasoning": {
                    "effort": "high"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": true
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Request successful. ",
              "content": {
                "text/event-stream": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Streaming responses are sent as Server-Sent Events (SSE) with `Content-Type: text/event-stream`.\n\n**Standard output**\n\n- **Text delta event**: `event: response.output_text.delta`\n  - `data.delta`: The incremental text content in the stream\n  - `data.type`: Event type, always `response.output_text.delta`\n- **Completion event**: `event: response.completed`\n  - `data.response.usage`: Token usage information, such as `input_tokens` and `output_tokens`\n\n**Function Calling**\n\n- **Function call arguments delta event**: `event: response.function_call_arguments.delta`\n  - `data.delta`: Incremental string content of the function call arguments\n  - `data.type`: Event type, always `response.function_call_arguments.delta`\n- **Completion event**: `event: response.completed`\n  - `data.response.usage`: Token usage information, such as `input_tokens` and `output_tokens`\n\nThe stream ends with a response.completed event (response.failed or response.incomplete on failure)."
                  },
                  "example": "{\n  \"output\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"reasoning\",\n      \"id\": \"rs_xxx\",\n      \"summary\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"message\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"id\": \"msg_xxx\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"output_text\",\n          \"text\": \"Hello! How can I help you today?\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"total_tokens\": 4490,\n    \"output_tokens\": 47,\n    \"input_tokens\": 4443\n  },\n  \"credits_consumed\": 0.48,\n  \"status\": \"completed\"\n}"
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "400": {
              "description": "Bad Request - Invalid request parameters",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "message": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "Invalid request parameters"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "invalid_request_error"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "message": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "Unauthorized"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "authentication_error"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "429": {
              "description": "Rate Limited - Too many requests",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "error": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "message": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "Rate limit exceeded"
                            ]
                          },
                          "type": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "examples": [
                              "rate_limit_error"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "500": {
              "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error",
              "description": "Server error."
            }
          },
          "security": [
            {
              "BearerAuth": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "webhooks": {},
    "components": {
      "schemas": {
        "ToolFunction": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Function call tool definition.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "function"
              ],
              "examples": [
                "function"
              ]
            },
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Function name.",
              "examples": [
                "get_current_weather"
              ]
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "A readable description of the function's purpose."
            },
            "parameters": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "JSON Schema describing function parameters.",
              "properties": {}
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type",
            "name",
            "description",
            "parameters"
          ]
        },
        "ToolWebSearch": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Online search tool configuration.",
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "web_search"
              ],
              "examples": [
                "web_search"
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "type"
          ]
        }
      },
      "responses": {
        "Error": {
          "description": "Server error.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {}
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "securitySchemes": {
        "BearerAuth": {
          "type": "http",
          "scheme": "bearer",
          "bearerFormat": "API Key",
          "description": "All API requests require a Bearer Token. Add the header `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY` to authenticate requests."
        }
      }
    },
    "servers": [
      {
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai",
        "description": "正式环境"
      }
    ],
    "security": [
      {
        "BearerAuth": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
